      en: ["Founded as an Illyrian settlement in the 4th century BC.", "Expanded by Byzantine Emperor Justinian I in the 6th century.", "Situated at an altitude of 380 meters above sea level.", "The fortress covers a total area of about 4 hectares.", "Captured by the Ottoman Empire in the year 1417.", "Served as the primary seat of the Arianiti noble family."],
