      ro: ["Construit între 1796 și 1798 de către Ali Pașa Tepelena.", "Dăruit ca zestre surorii sale, Shanisha, la nunta acesteia.", "Plan arhitectural patrulater cu patru turnuri poligonale la colțuri.", "A servit drept sediu administrativ pentru clanul Libohova.", "Amplasat la baza muntelui Bureto, dominând valea Drino.", "Lângă castel se află un platan secular, monument al naturii."],
      en: ["Built between 1796 and 1798 by Ali Pasha Tepelena.", "Commissioned as a wedding gift for his sister, Shanisha.", "Features a square plan with four large polygonal towers.", "Functioned as the primary residence of the Libohova family.", "Located at the foot of Bureto Mountain overlooking Drino Valley.", "The site is adjacent to a famous 200-year-old plane tree."],
