      en: ["The castle was constructed during the 16th or 17th century.", "It was the fortified seat of the influential Boçari family.", "The structure has a rectangular plan of approximately 30x18 meters.", "Two of the original four corner towers are still well-preserved.", "The stone walls range in thickness from 1.20 to 1.50 meters.", "The castle site overlooks the strategic Bay of Vlorë."],
