      en: ["The Church of St. Nicholas was constructed in the 13th century.", "It features rare exterior reliefs of dragons and mythical beasts.", "The church originally had an unusual double-apse design.", "It was built on the foundations of an even older ancient temple.", "The monastery is located on a fertile plain between two rivers.", "It is protected as a cultural monument of national importance."],
